      "content": "<p>Le cifre in base 3 sono $\\{0,1,2\\}$. Tutte le operazioni in colonna funzionano come in base 10, purché si usino le tavole corrette (i risultati sono scritti <em>in base 3</em>):</p>\n<div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:16px 0\"><table class=\"compare-table\"><caption style=\"text-align:left;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">Addizione (base 3)</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">$+$</th><th scope=\"col\">0</th><th scope=\"col\">1</th><th scope=\"col\">2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">0</th><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">1</th><td>1</td><td>2</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">2</th><td>2</td><td>10</td><td>11</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:16px 0\"><table class=\"compare-table\"><caption style=\"text-align:left;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">Moltiplicazione (base 3)</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">$\\cdot$</th><th scope=\"col\">0</th><th scope=\"col\">1</th><th scope=\"col\">2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">0</th><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">1</th><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">2</th><td>0</td><td>2</td><td>11</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
